  "blocks": [
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        73.38239288330078,
        527.3860473632812,
        87.82539367675781
      ],
      "text": "The TB/HIV policy has served as a vehicle for a robust global response, advocating for further",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        87.38239288330078,
        527.3903198242188,
        101.82539367675781
      ],
      "text": "investment and scale-up of collaborative TB/HIV activities, and has provided guidance to Member",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        101.38239288330078,
        527.4320678710938,
        115.82539367675781
      ],
      "text": "States and other partners on effectively addressing HIV-associated TB. It is estimated that scale-up",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        115.38239288330078,
        527.4081420898438,
        129.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "of these interventions between 2005-2022 has saved 9.2 million lives  .  Yet, despite impressive  (1) 2",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        129.3824005126953,
        527.4378051757812,
        143.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "uptake of collaborative TB/HIV activities and despite the advances in the prevention, diagnosis and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        143.3824005126953,
        527.4278564453125,
        157.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "treatment of TB disease, TB remains the leading cause of death among people living with HIV",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        157.3824005126953,
        527.4225463867188,
        171.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "worldwide, accounting for 167 000 (27%) of global HIV-related deaths in 2022  . In addition, gaps  (1)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        171.3824005126953,
        527.4080810546875,
        185.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "in TB/HIV collaborative activities remain. In 2022, only 64% of new TB episodes among people living",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        185.3824005126953,
        527.4200439453125,
        199.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "with HIV were diagnosed and notified, and the treatment success rate among people with HIV who",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        199.3824005126953,
        415.64019775390625,
        213.8253936767578
      ],
      "text": "started TB treatment in 2021 was 79%, lower than for all people with TB  . (1)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        225.12161254882812,
        177.31887817382812,
        247.30661010742188
      ],
      "text": "1.2\t Rationale",
      "font": "SegoeUI-SemiBold",
      "size": 17.0,
      "type": "heading_main"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        255.3824005126953,
        527.426025390625,
        269.8254089355469
      ],
      "text": "Since the   was published in 2012, there have been  WHO policy on collaborative TB/HIV activities (10)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        269.38238525390625,
        527.4100952148438,
        283.8254089355469
      ],
      "text": "remarkable scientific advances and consequently, updated WHO recommendations on screening,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        283.38238525390625,
        405.3893127441406,
        297.8254089355469
      ],
      "text": "diagnosis, treatment and prevention of HIV-associated TB. These include:",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        311.38238525390625,
        78.23609924316406,
        325.8254089355469
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        90.70870208740234,
        311.38238525390625,
        527.4219360351562,
        325.8254089355469
      ],
      "text": "evidence on the overwhelming benefit of a combination of early ART and TPT in preventing TB",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        90.70870208740234,
        325.3824157714844,
        403.9195251464844,
        339.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "and reducing morbidity and mortality among people living with HIV;",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        339.3824157714844,
        78.23609924316406,
        353.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        90.70870208740234,
        339.3824157714844,
        361.05029296875,
        353.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "the development of shorter rifamycin-based TPT regimens;",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        353.3824157714844,
        78.23609924316406,
        367.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        90.70870208740234,
        353.3824157714844,
        527.4109497070312,
        367.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "C-reactive protein (CRP), chest X-ray (CXR) (including CAD software to interpret digital X-ray)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        90.70870208740234,
        367.3824157714844,
        527.3954467773438,
        381.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "and molecular WHO-recommended rapid diagnostic tests (mWRD) for TB screening among",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        90.70870208740234,
        381.3824157714844,
        512.3585815429688,
        395.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "people living with HIV, in addition to the WHO-recommended four symptom screen (W4SS);",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        395.3824157714844,
        78.23609924316406,
        409.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        90.70870208740234,
        395.3824157714844,
        527.4296875,
        409.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "the scale-up of molecular diagnostic tests to diagnose TB using a range of specimens, including",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        90.70870208740234,
        409.3824157714844,
        527.4363403320312,
        423.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "non-sputum-based specimens such as urine or blood, recommended by WHO for the detection",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        90.70870208740234,
        423.3824157714844,
        297.8519592285156,
        437.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "of both pulmonary and extra-pulmonary TB;",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        437.3824157714844,
        78.23609924316406,
        451.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        90.70870208740234,
        437.3824157714844,
        255.4337921142578,
        451.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "LF-LAM to support in TB diagnosis;",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        451.3824157714844,
        78.23609924316406,
        465.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        90.70870208740234,
        451.3824157714844,
        527.4054565429688,
        465.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "new antiretroviral therapy (ART) regimens as well as earlier start of ART after TB treatment",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        90.70870208740234,
        465.3824157714844,
        132.07968139648438,
        479.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "initiation;",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        479.3824157714844,
        78.23609924316406,
        493.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        90.70870208740234,
        479.3824157714844,
        227.82371520996094,
        493.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "new strategies for HIV testing;",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        493.3824157714844,
        78.23609924316406,
        507.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        90.70870208740234,
        493.3824157714844,
        236.51150512695312,
        507.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "shorter TB treatment regimens;",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        507.3824462890625,
        78.23609924316406,
        521.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        90.70870208740234,
        507.3824462890625,
        527.4439086914062,
        521.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "treatment support interventions and models of care that aim to make prevention and treatment",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        90.70870208740234,
        521.3824462890625,
        211.77911376953125,
        535.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "more people-centred; and",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        535.3824462890625,
        78.23609924316406,
        549.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        90.70870208740234,
        535.3824462890625,
        527.4066162109375,
        549.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "diagnosis and management of the most common infections in people with advanced HIV",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        90.70870208740234,
        549.3824462890625,
        126.64569091796875,
        563.825439453125
      ],
      "text": "disease.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        577.3823852539062,
        527.4013671875,
        591.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "Based on this evidence, new WHO recommendations have been formulated, updated and published",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        591.3823852539062,
        527.4009399414062,
        605.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "in WHO guidelines on TB   and on HIV  . The TB/HIV guidelines consolidate all  (10, 11, 13-17, 21) (21)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        605.3823852539062,
        527.443359375,
        619.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "WHO recommendations related to reducing the burden of TB among people living with HIV and to",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        619.3823852539062,
        281.3236389160156,
        633.8253784179688
      ],
      "text": "reducing the burden of HIV in people with TB.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        281.3216857910156,
        620.5082397460938,
        284.6243896484375,
        628.9285278320312
      ],
      "text": "3",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 6.413000106811523,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03669738769531,
        670.4449462890625,
        526.6072387695312,
        680.9489135742188
      ],
      "text": "To estimate the number of deaths averted by collaborative TB/HIV activities, the actual numbers of TB deaths can be compared with",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        671.2637329101562,
        73.26805877685547,
        677.3875732421875
      ],
      "text": "2",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 4.664000034332275,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        680.044921875,
        526.6246948242188,
        690.5488891601562
      ],
      "text": "the number of TB deaths that would have occurred in the absence of antiretroviral therapy (ART) provided alongside TB treatment for",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        689.6449584960938,
        526.573974609375,
        700.14892578125
      ],
      "text": "people with HIV-associated TB. This number can be estimated conservatively as the number of estimated incident cases multiplied by",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        699.2449340820312,
        526.6268920898438,
        709.7489013671875
      ],
      "text": "the relevant estimated case fatality ratio for untreated HIV-associated TB. The estimates are conservative because they do not account",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        708.8449096679688,
        526.6324462890625,
        719.348876953125
      ],
      "text": "for the impact of TB services or availability of ART or TB preventive treatment on the level of TB incidence; they also do not account",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        718.4449462890625,
        436.4571533203125,
        728.9489135742188
      ],
      "text": "for the indirect, downstream impact of these interventions on future levels of infections, cases and deaths.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03669738769531,
        733.7142944335938,
        526.5640258789062,
        744.21826171875
      ],
      "text": "Recommendations are consolidated in the existing language of the source guideline. Since these recommendations were published,",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        734.5331420898438,
        73.26805877685547,
        740.656982421875
      ],
      "text": "3",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 4.664000034332275,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        743.3143310546875,
        526.6019897460938,
        753.8182983398438
      ],
      "text": "the use of language in relation to HIV and TB has evolved to ensure that the terminology used is non-stigmatizing, people-centred",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        752.914306640625,
        524.409912109375,
        763.4182739257812
      ],
      "text": "and human rights-based. The wording of recommendations will be updated appropriately during the next respective guideline devel­",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        85.03939819335938,
        762.5143432617188,
        140.49380493164062,
        773.018310546875
      ],
      "text": "opment process.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        42.8661003112793,
        801.2599487304688,
        46.98609924316406,
        811.763916015625
      ],
      "text": "2",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        801.2599487304688,
        136.43409729003906,
        811.763916015625
      ],
      "text": "WHO consolidated",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
